                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" style="fill:#00b67a;"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
